## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical API design for client resilience and caching.

## Key Concepts
- Idempotency in POST; client-side cache keys; offline mode handling; end-to-end testing strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
class CcaClientCache {
  // simple in-memory cache for demo
  constructor(ttl=60000) {
    this.ttl = ttl; this.store = new Map();
  }
  get(key){ const v=this.store.get(key); if(!v) return null; if(Date.now()-v.t > this.ttl) { this.store.delete(key); return null; } return v.value; }
  set(key, value){ this.store.set(key, {value, t: Date.now()}); }
}
```

